1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,294
Light behaves like the rope, never like the spring.

2
00:00:03,294 --> 00:00:10,716
The fact that turning the analyser can cut the light off completely means its vibrations lie across the beam.

3
00:00:10,716 --> 00:00:16,341
Polarization is the one optical effect that proves light is a transverse wave.

4
00:00:16,341 --> 00:00:20,221
Sound, being longitudinal, can never be polarized.

